  "prefLabel": "Dec 103.03 Method of Committee Operations",
  "priorExpiration": "2001-03-17",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Dec 103.03 Method of Committee Operations.\n\n(a) The committee performs its statutory responsibilities in determining and establishing a nuclear decommissioning financing fund and a schedule of payments of monies into such fund, by initiating proceedings for the specific nuclear electric energy facility and by holding all necessary meetings and hearings.\n\n(b) The committee is assisted in carrying out these responsibilities by hiring clerical and technical assistance on a temporary basis, such as its administrative assistant and its special legal counsel, as provided in RSA 162-F:17, II.\n\nSource. #4235, eff 2-20-87, EXPIRED: 2-20-93\n\nNew. #5700, INTERIM, eff 9-17-93, EXPIRED: 1-15-94\n\nNew. #5824, eff 8-30-94, EXPIRED: 8-30-00\n\nNew. #7366, INTERIM, eff 9-18-00, EXPIRED: 3-17-01\n\nNew. #9143, eff 4-25-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/dec100-200.html"
